Yes! its been a while...BUT its that time again finally! C'mon kids its time to get your drumming hands out and dancing shoes on! We are starting 2015 with an extraordinary drum sing dance workshop where you guys get to teach us how to drum! and there is a PRIZE for the most valuable drumming insight....all you have to do is tell us "What does it take to be a good drummer?". Write your answer down and bring it with you to the next DRUM SING DANCE on January 13th 10am in Palmwoods.  Bookings essential. [Contact us.](/contact-us-2/)
